NOTES
    J1 A8/B8 (SBU1/SBU2) are NC.
    U4 pins 1,2,10,11,13,14,15,16,19,20 are NC.
    U5 pins 9,10,11,12,13,14 are NC (unused channels 3 and 4).
    SW1 OFF: U5 D1-S1A and D2-S2A (Dupont).
    SW1 ON : U5 D1-S1B and D2-S2B (Type-C).
    Type-C VBUS is sense-only; it does not power VCC or VMOTOR_10V.
